WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Apollo 15 astronaut David Scott stands on the Moon with the objects for a gravity demonstration.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Scott releases a hammer and a feather together in the near-vacuum of the lunar surface.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Both objects reached the ground together. Historical NASA television, August 2, 1971.
